# Kubernetes secrets. Only the *.example templates are tracked — a filled-in
# secret.yaml / secrets.yaml must never reach the index (#1476).
# `secret.yaml.example` does not end in `.yaml`, so the templates stay tracked.
**/secret*.yaml
